Wraps text in <code><nowiki><sup></nowiki></code> tags to render it as superscript. Most often used for ordinal suffixes and short annotations inside song lists and prose.

==Syntax==
{{T|Sup|v1=text}}

==Examples==
{| class="wikitable"
! Code !! Result
|-
| <code><nowiki>{{Sup|th}}</nowiki></code> || {{Sup|th}}
|-
| <code><nowiki>4{{Sup|th}} anniversary</nowiki></code> || 4{{Sup|th}} anniversary
|}

{| class="dataTable sortable"
